@startuml
!include ../../_common/style.puml

title Redisson Native Fencing（RFencedLock）

actor Biz
participant DistributedLockClient as Client
participant LockAcquisitionService as Acquire
participant FencingTokenCoordinator as Fencing
participant ProviderNativeLockWaiter as Waiter
participant RedissonLockProvider as Provider
participant RedissonOwnershipRegistry as Ownership
participant RFencedLock as RFenced
participant Redis

Biz -> Client : execute(lockName, options)
Client -> Acquire : acquire
Acquire -> Fencing : plan(provider=redisson)
Fencing --> Acquire : NATIVE
Acquire -> Waiter : waitForLock
Waiter -> Provider : acquire(nativeFencingRequired=true)
Provider -> Ownership : reserve(ownerToken, lockKey, currentThreadId)
Ownership --> Provider : ownership reserved
Provider -> RFenced : tryLockAndGetToken(wait, lease)
RFenced -> Redis : atomic acquire + fencing token increment
Redis --> RFenced : token=N / not acquired
RFenced --> Provider : token=N
Provider --> Waiter : ACQUIRED(LockLease token=N)
Waiter --> Acquire : ACQUIRED
Acquire --> Client : LockHandle
Client --> Biz : callback(handle, fencingToken=N)

note right of Provider
  不采用 tryLock() 后再 getToken()：
  两次调用之间存在 lease 过期并被其他 owner
  再次获取的竞态，会导致 token 错配。
end note
@enduml
